# Shazam

> Shazam is a music discovery platform by Apple that identifies songs, connects fans with artists, and tracks music trends worldwide.

Shazam helps people identify songs playing around them and discover new music. The platform processes billions of recognitions and is one of the world's largest sources of real-time music discovery data. Shazam is available as a mobile app (iOS, Android), built into Apple devices, and on the web at shazam.com.

- Shazam.com hosts pages for millions of artists, songs, and albums, hundreds of music charts, and radio airplay tracking across 21 locales
- Shazam charts are unique — they are based on real-time song identification data (what people are actually hearing and searching for), not streams or sales. This makes them a leading indicator of music trends, often surfacing hits weeks before they appear on streaming charts
- Shazam tracks radio airplay data, showing which songs are being played on radio stations — a valuable signal for music industry trend analysis
- All song pages link to Apple Music for streaming. Shazam is deeply integrated with Apple Music as the primary listening destination
- URL patterns use the format `/{pageType}/{id}/{slug}`, e.g. `/artist/40543550/adele` or `/song/648859694/flowers`
- Localized pages use a locale prefix such as `/de/`, `/fr/`, `/ja/`. The default (English) has no prefix
- Artist pages include Schema.org `MusicGroup` JSON-LD. Song pages include `MusicRecording` JSON-LD

## Charts

Shazam charts reflect what people are identifying in real time — in shops, clubs, restaurants, cars, and public spaces worldwide. Unlike streaming or sales charts, Shazam data captures organic music discovery moments, making it a unique signal for trending and emerging music.

- [Shazam Top 200 — World](https://www.shazam.com/charts/top-200/world): The 200 most Shazamed songs globally, updated regularly
- [Shazam Viral — World](https://www.shazam.com/charts/viral/world): Songs gaining the fastest momentum in Shazam identifications worldwide. An early signal for breakout hits
- [Shazam Discovery — UK](https://www.shazam.com/charts/discovery/united-kingdom): Songs discovered for the first time by Shazam users in a given country. Surfaces emerging artists before they chart
- [Shazam Top 200 — United States](https://www.shazam.com/charts/top-200/united-states): Top 200 most Shazamed songs in the US
- [Shazam Top 200 — United Kingdom](https://www.shazam.com/charts/top-200/united-kingdom): Top 200 most Shazamed songs in the UK
- [Genre Charts — World](https://www.shazam.com/charts/genre/world/afrobeats): Top Shazamed songs by genre (Afrobeats, Alternative, Country, Dance, Hip-Hop, Pop, R&B, Rock, and more)
- [City Charts](https://www.shazam.com/charts/top-50/united-states/new-york): Top 50 most Shazamed songs in specific cities. Available for major cities worldwide
- [Chart Sitemap](https://www.shazam.com/sitemaps/charts/index.xml): Full index of all chart pages across 5 chart types (Top 200, Top 50 City, Viral, Discovery, Genre) and 70+ countries

## Radio Airplay

- [Radio Spins](https://www.shazam.com/radiospins): Radio airplay tracking — shows which songs and artists are being played on radio stations. See how often a song is spun, which stations are playing it, and how radio play correlates with Shazam discovery trends

## Content Pages

- [Song Page](https://www.shazam.com/song/648859694/flowers): Song metadata, lyrics, music video, album info, Apple Music streaming link, and similar tracks. URL pattern: `/song/{id}/{slug}`
- [Artist Page](https://www.shazam.com/artist/40543550/adele): Biography, discography, top tracks, upcoming events, music videos, and social links. URL pattern: `/artist/{id}/{slug}`
- [Album Page](https://www.shazam.com/album/1739659134/hit-me-hard-and-soft): Full tracklist, release date, editorial notes, and artist info. URL pattern: `/album/{id}/{slug}`
- [Event Pages](https://www.shazam.com/events): Upcoming concerts, festivals, and live music events linked to artists and venues
- [Fast Forward](https://www.shazam.com/fastforward2026): Shazam's emerging artist discovery programme, spotlighting rising talent identified through Shazam data

## Apps & Platforms

- [Shazam App](https://www.shazam.com/apps): Download Shazam for iOS, Android, and as a Chrome browser extension
